#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:109
msgid ""
"<qt>Choose which interface you like best.<p><strong>Kate MDI</strong> "
"(default):<br>All documents are kept within one main window, and you must "
"choose the document to edit from the \"Document\" menu, or from the File "
"List.<p><strong>Kate SDI</strong>:<br>A Single Document Interface opens only "
"one document in each window. The File List/File Selector will have it's own "
"window by default. You can <code>ALT-TAB</code> your way to the desired "
"document.<p><strong>Note:</strong> You need to restart Kate for this setting "
"to take effect.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Cho.n giao die^.n ma` ba.n u+a thi'ch nha^'t</p><strong>Kate MDI</strong> "
"( ma(.c ddi.nh ):<br>Mo.i ta`i lie^.u se~ ddu+o+.c giu+~ trong cu`ng mo^.t cu+ ?aso^?"
"chi'nh, ba.n pha?i cho.n ta`i lie^.u tu+` \"Ta`i lie^.u\" cu?a thu+.c ddo+n dde^? soa.n tha?o chu'ng."
"List.<p><strong>Kate SDI</strong>:<br>Giao die^.n vo+'i mo^.t  ta`i lie^.u duy nha^'t"
".Mo+? mo^~i ta`i lie^.u trong mo^.t cu+?a so^? rie^ng bie^.t.Danh sa'ch file va` tri`nh cho.n file"
"se~ co' cu+?a so^? rie^ng cu?a chu'ng. Ba.n co' the^? du`ng <code>ALT-TAB</code> dde^? chuye^?n"
".<p><strong>Chu' y':</strong> Ba.n pha?i kho+?i ddo^.ng la.i Kate dde^? ca'c thie^'t la^.p tro+? ne^n"
"co' ta'c du.ng.</qt>"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:118
msgid "At Startup"
msgstr "Va`o lu'c kho+?i ddo^.ng"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:121
msgid "Reopen &Files"
msgstr "Mo+? la.i &file"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:125
msgid ""
"If this is enabled Kate will attempt to reopen files that were open when you "
"closed last time. Cursor position will be recovered if possible. Non-"
"existent files will not be opened."
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:132
msgid "Restore &View Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Check this if you want all your views and frames restored each time you open "
"Kate"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:139
msgid "&Restrict to single process"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:143
msgid ""
"If this is checked, you can only start one instance of Kate. If you try, the "
"current instance will get the focus, and open any files you requested opened."
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:147
msgid "Show Full &Path in Title"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:152
msgid "&Show Content when resizing views"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:155
msgid ""
"If this is disabled, resizing views will display a <i>rubberband</i> to show "
"the new sizes untill you release the mouse button."
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:160
msgid "Sync &Konsole with active document"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:163
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the built in Konsole will <code>cd</code> to the "
"directory of the active document when started and whenever the active "
"document changes, if the document is a local file."
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:169
msgid "&Number of recent files"
msgstr ""

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:174
msgid ""
"<qt>Sets the number of recent files remembered by Kate.<p><strong>NOTE:</"
"strong>If you set this lower than the current value, the list will be "
"truncated and some items forgotten.</qt>"
msgstr ""

